=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Cheupirudaux (A)} (E-7), near Conflux #04 or Conflux #08 in {z:Abyssea - Vunkerl}.
** He will give you a {@k} {k:Woodworker's belt} and x2 {@i:Viscous Spittle|2953} {i:Viscous Spittle|Viscous Spittle|2953}.
* Examine the **Derelict Bridge** targetable location at (F-7).
** If it creaks, trade x2 {i:Viscous Spittle|Viscous Spittle|2953}.
** If it wavers, trade x4 {i:Viscous Spittle|Viscous Spittle|2953}.
** If it crumbles, trade x5 {i:Viscous Spittle|Viscous Spittle|2953}.
*** If you need more {i:Viscous Spittle|Viscous Spittle|2953}, they drop from {m:Spitting Spiders|Spitting Spider} east of Conflux #05.
* Return to Cheupirudaux to receive your reward.

__Zoning **is** required to repeat this quest.__
=3 Subsequent attempts
* Speak to {p:Cheupirudaux (A)} (E-7), near Conflux #04 or Conflux #08 in {z:Abyssea - Vunkerl}.
** He will give you the {@k} {k:Woodworker's belt}, but you will have to have to obtain your own {@i:Viscous Spittle|2953} {i:Viscous Spittle|Viscous Spittle|2953} from {m:Spitting Spiders|Spitting Spider} east of Conflux #05.
* Repeat the process above, examine a bridge, and make repairs the the bridge with Spittle accordingly:
** If it creaks, trade x2 {i:Viscous Spittle|Viscous Spittle|2953}.
** If it wavers, trade x4 {i:Viscous Spittle|Viscous Spittle|2953}.
** If it crumbles, trade x5 {i:Viscous Spittle|Viscous Spittle|2953}.
* It is likely the more bridges you repair, the more {p:Cruor} you receive. It is unknown if fame earned varies or not based on how many bridges repaired.
* Return to Cheupirudaux to receive your reward.

